~ apple
- How are you?
    Apple: ...
    Apple: ...
    Apple: ...
    Clay: Are you going to say anything, or...?
    Apple: ...
    Clay: Nice talk.
    => apple
- Where is your mom?
    Apple points to the front of the house
    Clay: Figures...
