    Teddy: I’m always tired from the day and the store is closed, so I have nothing to do.
    Clay: You don’t hang out with Harper?
    Teddy: I do when I can, but she is always off in her room.
    Teddy: She stays up way too late studyi-[next=auto]
    Clay: You realize I know Harper, right?
    Clay: We grew up together?
    Teddy: Oh. [wait=1] That’s right!
    Clay: ...
    => teddy
- Never mind.
=> END

